      "dependency_compatibility": "Trix3.2.5-compatible requirement accepts3.4.17; optional@types/trusted-types2.0.7 remains unchanged. No jsdom/happy-dom server runtime is added. Browser DOM is the runtime. Trix uses sanitize/setConfig/addHook/isValidAttribute; config RETURN_DOM=true, SAFE_FOR_XML=false with selected SAFE_FOR_XML=true composition path, ADD_ATTR=[language]. No app IN_PLACE,SAFE_FOR_TEMPLATES,custom element allowlist or Trusted Types policy is configured. DOM input/RETURN_DOM/setConfig/hook fixes are directly relevant, even where other advisory modes are absent.",
      "code_references": [
        "assets/vendor/trix/src/trix/config/dompurify.js",
